# Check text files out with LF on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# The parser tests locate fixture lines with strings such as 'import indented_mod\n', and the
# packaged files must not depend on who built them. Tests that need CRLF build it in the string.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.vsix binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
